{"ts":"2026-11-03T20:02:51.299Z","event":"hook","session":"e45d-a18b4f189c18","seq":1,"tag":"fam","harness":"agy","decision":"allow","tool":"call_mcp_tool","server":"council_council","tool_call":{"args":{"Arguments":{"action":"speak","round":"r4","text":"I agree with indep and plan's points: cross-family review reduces correlated errors rather than eliminating them, and operational constraints make the review actionable. Because this committee's rules offer 'withdraw' rather than direct motion amendment for makers, I am ready to withdraw the current motion in the next round if someone moves a synthesized replacement, or let this proceed to a vote as everyone already expressed willingness to vote yes on the core principle. To avoid procedural delay, if another member moves an amended text I will happily withdraw; otherwise I support voting on the pending motion."},"ServerName":"council_council","ToolName":"council_submit"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"conversation":"832da779-3a97-43c0-9b28-c38ed0a676e2","step":18,"model":"gemini-3.8-flash-low"}
